I might be wrong about this too, but I seem to remember reading this once
before:

A wish has 3 guaranteed 'credits'. Credits are:

 blessed status: 1 credit
 errodeproof (fireproof, rustproof): 1 credit
 # of items: 1 credit each

Thus wishing for 2 blessed ... is the most you can guarantee. Wishing for more
depends on your luck. If you are lucky, you may get what you wish for. If you
are unlucky, you will get less than you asked for, or without the
blessed/errodeproof status.
